[layers/hyperparameters] Hyperparameters layer (reviewing)
Files: crates/grimoire/tests/hyperparameters_layer.rs.
Build a typed hyperparameter layer against training/1: attach objective, optimizer, batch/step dials, phase records, trainable/frozen target references, and data sources to the group representing the training stage. Observe coverage through a finalized decoration check. Keep symbolic schedule functions deferred because the current schema/value algebra has no symbolic arithmetic or function constructor.
Accept: The valid layer parses and validates, the training check is visible after evaluation, changing a training dial leaves selected structure unchanged, and attaching training/1 to a port fails by schema attachment kind.
-> core/freeze
-> projlang/spec
-> schemas/axes
